  Nodes:
  - NodeID: Start
    SpeakerName: Sister K (Circle K Clerk)
    Text: You know, I respect the grind. Most people would have complained and quit
      by now.
    Choices: []
    DefaultNextNodeID: 1
    EventTrigger: {fileID: 0}
  - NodeID: 1
    SpeakerName: Player
    Text: Quitting isn't an option when you have bills to pay and a bike to feed.
    Choices: []
    DefaultNextNodeID: 2
    EventTrigger: {fileID: 0}
  - NodeID: 2
    SpeakerName: Sister K (Circle K Clerk)
    Text: "Same here. We\u2019re basically the backbone of this place, even if no
      one says thank you."
    Choices: []
    DefaultNextNodeID: 3
    EventTrigger: {fileID: 0}
  - NodeID: 3
    SpeakerName: Player
    Text: "I\u2019ll take a \"thank you\" in the form of a shorter route next time."
    Choices: []
    DefaultNextNodeID: 4
    EventTrigger: {fileID: 0}
  - NodeID: 4
    SpeakerName: Sister K (Circle K Clerk)
    Text: Hehe! If only life worked like that. Good luck out there!
    Choices: []
    DefaultNextNodeID: 
    EventTrigger: {fileID: 0}
